    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d281-a1">

                <pb facs="0446" n="358" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg358"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Telegram—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Montenegrin Acting Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Chotch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Montenegrin Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Gvosdenovitch</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Neuilly-sur-Seine</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-23">December 23,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Montenegrin Government declares that report that Skoupchtina voted for annexation
                    of Montenegro to Serbia is inaccurate. It is now preparing to return to
                    Montenegro. Skoupchtina will not be called until it returns in accordance with
                    Constitution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chotch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
